VE CHECKED", "y": 0.4792587211126394}, {"text": "Finished? Always check your writing.", "x": 0.5348837185625102, "y": 0.5056678702592741, "h": 0.012955776173285189, "w": 0.2719141303168403}, {"text": "Can you tick / everything on this list?", "y": 0.5197238372613286, "w": 0.275491943359375, "h": 0.013909883895075349, "x": 0.534883722309579}, {"w": 0.16636850992838537, "y": 0.5437500000868011, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "text": "In my email invitation:", "x": 0.5330948137969881}, {"w": 0.32915920681423605, "h": 0.012722955653813801, "text": "• I have started with an appropriate greeting,", "y": 0.5676985556875849, "x": 0.5366726360204311}, {"x": 0.5597137375352105, "w": 0.10955284966362844, "text": "e.g. Hi, Martha.", "y": 0.5807892236905772, "h": 0.015703529313152883}, {"h": 0.011453855618673034, "text": "• I have asked how my friend is", "x": 0.536672633232586, "y": 0.6057122094900014, "w": 0.23076922946506073}, {"h": 0.012741215719642991, "x": 0.5366726364300322, "text": "• I have invited my friend to my party.", "w": 0.275491943359375, "y": 0.6309070400438487}, {"y": 0.6562936048704517, "w": 0.30232557508680546, "x": 0.5366726366292268, "h": 0.011517766972311145, "text": "• I have given the details about the party."}, {"h": 0.012645348314774147, "y": 0.6803197675450111, "x": 0.5348837188395716, "text": "• I have finished the email appropriately.", "w": 0.2969588555230035}, {"y": 0.7068750002561714, "h": 0.01138081348329678, "x": 0.5348837272162205, "text": "• I have used an appropriate ending, e.g. Love,", "w": 0.343470458984375}, {"y": 0.7207848841457063, "h": 0.011412769160115788, "x": 0.5617173573129799, "w": 0.1144901529947916, "text": "Best wishes, etc."}, {"text": "• I have used contractions (e.g. I'm / aren't /", "x": 0.5348837198951558, "w": 0.3202146742078994, "h": 0.011431029974768718, "y": 0.744760830397512}, {"text": "that's).", "x": 0.5581395348559822, "w": 0.046511628892686674, "h": 0.01138081348329678, "y": 0.7599854653387295}, {"w": 0.323792487250